      "cooked": "<p>Hello Frappe Community,</p>\n<p>I am excited to share a new open-source backport that brings <strong>IFRS-style accounting report</strong> template support from newer ERPNext versions to ERPNext Version 15.</p>\n<p>This project was built to help Version 15 users get access to IFRS-oriented reporting capabilities without waiting for a full platform upgrade. It is packaged as a separate app, so it can be installed across multiple sites and improved independently.</p>\n<p>What this backport adds:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>IFRS-focused report template framework support for Version 15</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Template-driven financial report rendering</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>IFRS template options for key financial statements</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Compatibility approach designed for existing ERPNext Version 15 environments</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Available Reports</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Financial Ratios Analysis<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/7/5756745ad717f1ee0aedb05c4b1db4b985e9f201.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5756745ad717f1ee0aedb05c4b1db4b985e9f201\" title=\"Financial Ratios Analysis\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/7/5756745ad717f1ee0aedb05c4b1db4b985e9f201_2_690x297.png\" alt=\"Financial Ratios Analysis\" data-base62-sha1=\"csCLBFHcIlL3w3OjTbZIFA9UV2h\" width=\"690\" height=\"297\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/7/5756745ad717f1ee0aedb05c4b1db4b985e9f201_2_690x297.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/7/5756745ad717f1ee0aedb05c4b1db4b985e9f201_2_1035x445.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/7/5756745ad717f1ee0aedb05c4b1db4b985e9f201_2_1380x594.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F2F7FA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Financial Ratios Analysis</span><span class=\"informations\">1780×767 55.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Standard Cash Flow Statement (IFRS)<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/1/a1d560e678cf7382a4424329effc60a7cf6630c4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a1d560e678cf7382a4424329effc60a7cf6630c4\" title=\"Standard Cash Flow Statement (IFRS)\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/1/a1d560e678cf7382a4424329effc60a7cf6630c4_2_690x331.png\" alt=\"Standard Cash Flow Statement (IFRS)\" data-base62-sha1=\"n5E276pgt7jlhk5ruEPFBxay4v2\" width=\"690\" height=\"331\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/1/a1d560e678cf7382a4424329effc60a7cf6630c4_2_690x331.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/1/a1d560e678cf7382a4424329effc60a7cf6630c4_2_1035x496.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/1/a1d560e678cf7382a4424329effc60a7cf6630c4_2_1380x662.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EAECF6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Standard Cash Flow Statement (IFRS)</span><span class=\"informations\">1769×851 49.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Horizontal Balance Sheet (Columnar)<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/2/22c6e55c86fbd9af351fc550a52f8a7927bb88e9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/22c6e55c86fbd9af351fc550a52f8a7927bb88e9\" title=\"Horizontal Balance Sheet (Columnar)\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/2/22c6e55c86fbd9af351fc550a52f8a7927bb88e9_2_690x334.png\" alt=\"Horizontal Balance Sheet (Columnar)\" data-base62-sha1=\"4XEmJacriu8SG0obekTI5A8nBbz\" width=\"690\" height=\"334\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/2/22c6e55c86fbd9af351fc550a52f8a7927bb88e9_2_690x334.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/2/22c6e55c86fbd9af351fc550a52f8a7927bb88e9_2_1035x501.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/2/22c6e55c86fbd9af351fc550a52f8a7927bb88e9_2_1380x668.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EDF3F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Horizontal Balance Sheet (Columnar)</span><span class=\"informations\">1773×859 59.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Horizontal Profit and Loss (Columnar)<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/6/46b80be371d0f1fa4834542789d5d5195ab3e228.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/46b80be371d0f1fa4834542789d5d5195ab3e228\" title=\"Horizontal Profit and Loss (Columnar)\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/46b80be371d0f1fa4834542789d5d5195ab3e228_2_690x327.png\" alt=\"Horizontal Profit and Loss (Columnar)\" data-base62-sha1=\"a5BJUTREOiSToYHK1D7GYU5CRSw\" width=\"690\" height=\"327\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/46b80be371d0f1fa4834542789d5d5195ab3e228_2_690x327.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/46b80be371d0f1fa4834542789d5d5195ab3e228_2_1035x490.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/46b80be371d0f1fa4834542789d5d5195ab3e228_2_1380x654.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F1F3F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Horizontal Profit and Loss (Columnar)</span><span class=\"informations\">1756×834 46.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Standard Balance Sheet (IFRS)<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/4/64e27912f6935e09259c71522a34bd438945c7fa.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/64e27912f6935e09259c71522a34bd438945c7fa\" title=\"Standard Balance Sheet (IFRS)\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/4/64e27912f6935e09259c71522a34bd438945c7fa_2_690x335.png\" alt=\"Standard Balance Sheet (IFRS)\" data-base62-sha1=\"eosXI82PFvBQIoCr7AQDKHUUqBY\" width=\"690\" height=\"335\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/4/64e27912f6935e09259c71522a34bd438945c7fa_2_690x335.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/4/64e27912f6935e09259c71522a34bd438945c7fa_2_1035x502.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/4/64e27912f6935e09259c71522a34bd438945c7fa_2_1380x670.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EFF5FA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Standard Balance Sheet (IFRS)</span><span class=\"informations\">1732×841 46.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Standard Profit and Loss (IFRS)<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/3/b310caf75fbab4d01c9d9d2891272e780f010ba0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b310caf75fbab4d01c9d9d2891272e780f010ba0\" title=\"Standard Profit and Loss (IFRS)\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/3/b310caf75fbab4d01c9d9d2891272e780f010ba0_2_690x333.png\" alt=\"Standard Profit and Loss (IFRS)\" data-base62-sha1=\"py5rDgjj8C43ytDYCXrTy9Nc3cs\" width=\"690\" height=\"333\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/3/b310caf75fbab4d01c9d9d2891272e780f010ba0_2_690x333.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/3/b310caf75fbab4d01c9d9d2891272e780f010ba0_2_1035x499.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/3/b310caf75fbab4d01c9d9d2891272e780f010ba0_2_1380x666.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F0F3F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Standard Profit and Loss (IFRS)</span><span class=\"informations\">1759×849 50.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Project repository:</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/nipunanr/ifrs_reporting\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://github.com/nipunanr/ifrs_reporting</a></p>\n<p>The app is freely available for installation, testing, and use in your own environments. Community feedback is very valuable, especially from teams using IFRS reporting in production workflows.</p>\n<p><strong>Contributions are highly appreciated:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Bug reports and reproducible issues</li>\n<li>Feature improvements and UX enhancements</li>\n<li>Pull requests for fixes and refinements</li>\n<li>Documentation improvements and implementation guides</li>\n</ol>\n<p>If you are running ERPNext Version 15 and need stronger IFRS reporting support, please try the app and share your experience. Your feedback and contributions will help make this backport more stable and useful for everyone.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Thank you to the Frappe community for continuous support and collaboration.</strong></em></p>",
