      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/misltechnical\">@misltechnical</a></p>\n<p>Thanks for this.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Would it be possible to get a IFRS compliant <strong><span class=\"bbcode-u\">DIRECT</span></strong> cashflow report. Currently most software (including ERPNext) have indirect method. As you know in tough times - cash is king and EBITDA is just cooking the books</li>\n<li>Would be great if you can fill this form to get wider coverage: -</li>\n</ol>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/gavindsouza/awesome-frappe/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=new-submission&amp;projects=&amp;template=new_submission.yml&amp;title=Add%20this%20cool%20App+-+\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/favicons/favicon.svg\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/gavindsouza/awesome-frappe/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=new-submission&amp;projects=&amp;template=new_submission.yml&amp;title=Add%20this%20cool%20App+-+\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/assets/github-logo-55c5b9a1fe52.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" alt=\"\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/gavindsouza/awesome-frappe/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=new-submission&amp;projects=&amp;template=new_submission.yml&amp;title=Add%20this%20cool%20App+-+\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Build software better, together</a></h3>\n\n  <p>GitHub is where people build software. More than 150 million people use GitHub to discover, fork, and contribute to over 420 million projects.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
